000100 @OPTIONS MAIN,SRF(FIX,FIX),APOST
000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. URIAGE01.
000400*----------------------------------------------------------------
000500* 売上集計バッチ  サンプル（NetCOBOL 固定形式）
000600*----------------------------------------------------------------
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000900 SPECIAL-NAMES.
001000     CONSOLE IS CONS
001100     ARGUMENT-VALUE IS ARGV.
001200 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001300 FILE-CONTROL.
001400     SELECT URIAGE-FILE ASSIGN TO INFILE
001500         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
001600         FILE STATUS IS WS-FS.
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 FILE SECTION.
001900 FD  URIAGE-FILE.
002000 01  URIAGE-REC.
002100     05  TOKUI-CD          PIC X(06).
002200     05  得意先名          PIC N(10).
002300     05  KINGAKU           PIC S9(09)V99 COMP-3.
002400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002500 01  WS-FS                 PIC X(02).
002600     88  WS-EOF            VALUE "10".
002700 01  合計金額              PIC S9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.              V2.0
002800 01  WS-MSG                PIC N(20) VALUE NC"処理が終了しました".
002900 01  WS-HEX                PIC X(02) VALUE X"0D0A".
003000 01  FILLER                PIC X(10) VALUE SPACE.
003100     COPY KYOTUREC.
003200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003300 MAIN-PROC SECTION.
003400 開始処理.
003500     OPEN INPUT URIAGE-FILE
003600     PERFORM 2000-READ THRU 2000-EXIT
003700     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF
003800         ADD KINGAKU TO 合計金額
003900         PERFORM 2000-READ THRU 2000-EXIT
004000     END-PERFORM
004100D    DISPLAY "DEBUG: " 合計金額 UPON CONS
004200     EXEC SQL
004300         SELECT COUNT(*) INTO :WS-CNT FROM URIAGE
004400          WHERE TOKUI_CD = :TOKUI-CD
004500     END-EXEC
004600     DISPLAY WS-MSG UPON SYSERR    *> 浮動注記
004700     MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-DATE
004800     CLOSE URIAGE-FILE
004900     STOP RUN.
005000 2000-READ.
005100     READ URIAGE-FILE
005200         AT END CONTINUE
005300     END-READ.
005400 2000-EXIT.
005500     EXIT.
005600 END PROGRAM URIAGE01.
